  "title": "iGenius Launches One of the Worlds Largest Sovereign AI Data Centers Leveraging Vertiv Infrastructure, NVIDIA Accelerated Computing and Omniverse",
  "summary": "Vertiv (NYSE: VRT), a global provider of critical digital infrastructure, today announced a groundbreaking collaboration with NVIDIA and renowned AI pioneer iGenius (now Domyn) to deploy Colosseum, one of the world’s largest NVIDIA DGX AI supercomputers with NVIDIA Grace Blackwell Superchips. Set to deploy in 2025 in Italy, Colosseum will redefine the digital landscape through a first-of-its-kind sovereign AI data center for regulated workloads.",
